OL,3,GNEWSATeachers' unions vote in favour of
OL,4,Astrike action over workload
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's five teaching unions
OL,7,Fhave voted to strike if the Department
OL,8,Fof Education does not address
OL,9,Fgrievances over workload.
OL,11,FIn recent ballots, union members all
OL,12,Freturned large majorities in favour of
OL,13,Findustrial action.
OL,15,FThe unions said members were balloted
OL,16,Ffollowing "sustained failure to deliver
OL,17,Fa credible implementation plan for the
OL,18,F27 recommendations of the Independent
OL,19,FReview of Workload".
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
