OL,3,GNEWSATeachers' unions vote in favour of
OL,4,Astrike action over workload
OL,5,
OL,6,FEducation Minister Paul Givan said
OL,7,Fnegotiations on the issue had made
OL,8,F"significant progress" over the summer
OL,9,Fand he hoped the ongoing talks would be
OL,10,F"concluded positively to avoid
OL,11,Findustrial action".
